flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Store start wait time]
    B --> C{Wait time less than maximum}

    C -- No --> D[Print no valid packet received]
    D --> E([End])

    C -- Yes --> F[Create receive packet variable]
    F --> G[Receive LoRa packet]

    G --> H{Receive successful and packet not empty}

    H -- No --> I[Delay 10 ms]
    I --> C

    H -- Yes --> J[Print received packet]

    J --> K{Packet starts with V prefix}

    K -- No --> I

    K -- Yes --> L[Find comma positions]

    L --> M{Comma positions valid}

    M -- No --> I

    M -- Yes --> N[Extract sleep OLED and debug values]

    N --> O[Convert values to integer and boolean]

    O --> P{Values match current settings}

    P -- Yes --> Q[Print no changes needed]
    Q --> R([Return])

    P -- No --> S{Sleep value between 0 and 30}

    S -- Yes --> T[Update auxiliary sleep minutes]
    S -- No --> U[Keep existing sleep value]

    T --> V[Update OLED flag]
    U --> V

    V --> W[Print OLED flag update]

    W --> X[Update debug flag]

    X --> Y[Print debug flag update]

    Y --> Z[Save operator variables]

    Z --> AA([Return])
